  "terms_preamble_body": "These Terms of Use govern the relationship between Mooze Labs LLC and the User who, on the User's own and sole initiative, obtains, installs and uses the Mooze Wallet application.\n\nMaking the App available on global distribution platforms (Google Play Store, Apple App Store, similar stores or a public APK repository) constitutes the mere passive placement of software. Any use of the App results from the User's active search and voluntary interest, and the User represents that the User accesses Mooze by personal decision.",
